gemel
Copyright 2026 Juan Jose Comellas

gemel is a port to Rust of Unison, the file synchronizer
(https://github.com/bcpierce00/unison), made from Unison's source at commit
8772d26. It is derived from Unison, and is not an official Unison project.

gemel is free software, distributed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or (at your option) any later version; see LICENSE. The graphical
program, gemel-gui, uses Slint under Slint's GPL-3.0-only option, so that
program is distributed under version 3 of the License only.

Source: the corresponding source of a released package is the tag of the
same version at https://github.com/jcomellas/gemel.


